 If they have ever been helped as many other highly creative people as I have, they should acknowledge that their jobs have been made far easier. When they are being recognized, they are happy and appreciative.", "id": 1}, {"time": "27500", "image": "engenn9le17ob07re2img03.jpg", "text": "<br />This was the most important lesson I learned on my first film. That knowledge has helped me ever since. We have had some really complicated sets this time around. They could have caused problems. I was very confident, and saw every problem as a challenge to be overcome.<br /><br />In the past I would have carefully arranged the indoor scenes. I used to keep an eye on the costumes being designed to make sure that everything was perfect.", "id": 2}, {"time": "57000", "image": "engenn9le17ob07re2img02.jpg", "text": "<br />I would hold auditions that included both cold readings and improvisations. I used to make sure I had more than enough time to choose the best actors for the job. I used to do too much. Then I started to let everyone do what they came to do. I have never looked back.<br /><br />Today on set the actors have been left to me. The other work is being done by those I have come to trust and rely on. We've watched the rushes daily. They haven't  disappointed us, so we continue.  I'm glad I learned my lesson early. So are the others who work with me.", "id": 3}]}}], "template_override": 1, "title": "", "type": "audio", "id": 1, "_data": []}], "id": 0, "_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"type": "has_nav", "content": true}, {"type": "has_exercise_controls", "content": true}]}]}]}